    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "For your safety\nRepublic AiRLiNES\n727-200\nAiRCRAlT # 731,732,733\nFOR YOUR SAFETY, know the quickest way to get out of this plane.\nDo you know:\nWhere your exits are?\nHow to open the exits?\nHow to jump into the escape slide?\nFOR THE SAFETY OF OTHERS PLEASE DO NOT REMOVE CARD FROM AIRPLANE.\nP/N 0 - 0410-3 - 1871",
      "4\n5\n6\nDON'T USE RADIOS\nOR SEE-THRU LIGHTERS\nInflation\nIfno inflation,\nblow into tubes.\nInflate life jacket outside aircraft\n1\n2\n3\nCopyright (1\nC Interaction Research Corporation, 1984. Olympia, WA\nAll rights reserved.\nCode 260",
      "3\n5\nSEC\n3\nSEC\n3.\n3\n2\n5\n5"
